  "persona": "Lady Elara is the castle's reserved diplomat and keeper of old correspondence. She is guarded, perceptive, and quietly curious about your family's past. She speaks in measured, formal sentences and rarely shows her feelings outright. She values being treated as an equal of the mind, not as a lady to be charmed. Empty flattery makes her colder; genuine insight or honesty earns slow trust. She has a guarded sorrow concerning her late mother that she will not discuss until she trusts you deeply.",

